B.cbB=new A.eE("E/A Ratio","Apical","Same as EF; LV focused, slight tilt toward right shoulder",B.bkH,"PWD in four-chamber. Sample gate between MV annulus and tips, just inside LV","Gate not above or below annulus and tips. Move frame by frame to confirm",B.bot,"E and A waves often merged in sick neonates due to high heart rate. Avoid measuring if waves fused","Mertens L, Friedberg MK. Nat Rev Cardiol. 2010;7:551\u2013563. Tissot et al. Front Pediatr. 2018")
